# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# Format: /old-path  /new-path  301
#
# Category archive pages retired 2026-09-26 — every category hub now
# lists every post in that category, so the noindexed overflow pages
# are gone. Both trailing-slash and no-slash forms redirect so nothing
# 404s or chains through the (now-removed) directory-index mechanic.
/blog/songs/archive/     /blog/songs/     301
/blog/songs/archive      /blog/songs/     301
/blog/artists/archive/   /blog/artists/   301
/blog/artists/archive    /blog/artists/   301
/blog/genres/archive/    /blog/genres/    301
/blog/genres/archive     /blog/genres/    301
/blog/trivia/archive/    /blog/trivia/    301
/blog/trivia/archive     /blog/trivia/    301
/blog/archive/           /blog/           301
/blog/archive            /blog/           301
